[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/5464864596","html_url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/issues/682#issuecomment-5464864596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/682","id":5464864596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFhfz288AAAABRbs3VA","user":{"login":"kolyshkin","id":4522509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjI1MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4522509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin","html_url":"https://github.com/kolyshkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T21:02:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T21:02:19Z","body":"Being fixed by #683; PTAL @rhysd ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/5464864596/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/6133365760","html_url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/issues/682#issuecomment-6133365760","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/682","id":6133365760,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFhfz288AAAABbZO8AA","user":{"login":"gander","id":421597,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTU5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/421597?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander","html_url":"https://github.com/gander","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gander/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T21:57:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T21:57:54Z","body":"@rhysd, I want to start by saying that maintaining a popular project is a heavy burden. Everyone depends on it, everyone has an opinion, and the complaints never stop, especially when life gets in the way and you simply don’t have the time. Nobody is owed free work, and I’m grateful for everything you’ve built here.\n\nBut if you don’t have the time or energy anymore, it’s okay to say so. Honestly, it’s the best thing you can do for the people who rely on this tool. Please don’t wait until the last moment to decide. Silence leaves everyone guessing whether to wait for the next release or move on, and that uncertainty is harder on the community than a clear “I’m stepping back”.\n\nIf you’re done, say it plainly and hand the project to someone who has the time and the motivation, whether that’s new co-maintainers with merge and release rights, or a fork you trust. If you’re still here, a short “I’m back, releases are coming” would be enough. Either answer is fine. Not knowing is the only bad one.\n\nThank you for all the work so far, whatever you decide.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/6133365760/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/6135238971","html_url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/issues/682#issuecomment-6135238971","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/682","id":6135238971,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFhfz288AAAABbbBROw","user":{"login":"kolyshkin","id":4522509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjI1MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4522509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin","html_url":"https://github.com/kolyshkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolyshkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T00:25:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T21:15:30Z","body":"@gander I suggest you to switch to the fork at https://github.com/kjanat/actionlint which fixes many issues found here (and keeps maintaining the scripts).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/6135238971/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/6203550186","html_url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/issues/682#issuecomment-6203550186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/682","id":6203550186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFhfz288AAAABccKp6g","user":{"login":"Ultra-Solo","id":235407217,"node_id":"U_kgDODggHcQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235407217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo","html_url":"https://github.com/Ultra-Solo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ultra-Solo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T22:26:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T22:26:16Z","body":"**Workaround available today (verified end-to-end):** declare the labels through actionlint's own config, `.github/actionlint.yaml`:\n\n```yaml\nself-hosted-runner:\n  labels:\n    - ubuntu-26.04\n    - ubuntu-26.04-arm\n```\n\nThis is the documented config for labels the runner-label data doesn't know yet (docs/config.md); the rule keeps checking everything else.\n\nContext: we run a project template whose full CI gate (its own chassis plus 7 generated projects, each linting its own workflows) moved to `ubuntu-26.04`/`-arm` ahead of the `ubuntu-latest` flip. On 1.7.12 (latest) every `runs-on: ubuntu-26.04` 